 all, follow the rule\uc1 \u8212 ?}{\fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af5 \loch \f5 \lang4105 \langnp4105 \langfe4105 \langfenp4105 \line }{\cs22 \fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af5 \loch \f5 \uc1 \u160 ?\uc1 \u160 ?\uc1 \u160 ?\uc1 \u160 ?\uc1 \u160 ? messengers should never seek to carry out}{\cs22 \fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af5 \loch \f5 \tab }{\cs26 \fs18 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af5 \loch \f5 750}{\fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af5 \loch \f5 \lang4105 \langnp4105 \langfe4105 \langfenp4105 \line }{\cs22 \fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af5 \loch \f5 \uc1 \u160 ?\uc1 \u160 ?\uc1 \u160 ?\uc1 \u160 ?\uc1 \u160 ? more than they are told\uc1 \u8212 ?and then, beyond that,}{\fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af5 \loch \f5 \lang4105 \langnp4105 \langfe4105 \langfenp4105 \line }{\cs22 \fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af5 \loch \f5 \uc1 \u160 ?\uc1 \u160 ?\uc1 \u160 ?\uc1 \u160 ?\uc1 \u160 ? make sure you earn my thanks as well as his,}{\fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af5 \loch \f5 \lang4105 \langnp4105 \langfe4105 \langfenp4105 \line }{\cs22 \fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af5 \loch \f5 \uc1 \u160 ?\uc1 \u160 ?\uc1 \u160 ?\uc1 \u160 ?\uc1 \u160 ? and win yourself a double gratitude.}{\fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af5 \loch \f5 \lang4105 \langnp4105 \langfe4105 \langfenp4105 \line }{\fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af5 \loch \f5 \lang4105 \langnp4105 \langfe4105 \langfenp4105 \line }{\cs22 \fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af5 \loch \f5 LICHAS}{\fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af5 \loch \f5 \lang4105 \langnp4105 \langfe4105 \langfenp4105 \line }{\cs22 \fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af5 \loch \f5 \uc1 \u160 ?\uc1 \u160 ?\uc1 \u160 ?\uc1 \u160 ?\uc1 \u160 ? If as a messenger I have any skill}{\cs22 \fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af5 \loch \f5 \tab }{\cs22 \fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af5 \loch \f5 \tab }{\cs26 \fs18 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af5 \loch \f5 [620]}{\fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af5 \loch \f5 \lang4105 \langnp4105 \langfe4105 \langfenp4105 \line }{\cs22 \fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af5 \loch \f5 \uc1 \u160 ?\uc1 \u160 ?\uc1 \u160 ?\uc1 \u160 ?\uc1 \u160 ? practising the art of herald Hermes,}{\fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af5 \loch \f5 \lang4105 \langnp4105 \langfe4105 \langfenp4105 \line }{\cs22 \fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af5 \loch \f5 \uc1 \u160 ?\uc1 \u160 ?\uc1 \u160 ?\uc1 \u160 ?\uc1 \u160 ? I will not fail to do what you have asked.}{\fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af5 \loch \f5 \lang4105 \langnp4105 \langfe4105 \langfenp4105 \line }{\cs22 \fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af5 \loch \f5 \uc1 \u160 ?\uc1 \u160 ?\uc1 \u160 ?\uc1 \u160 ?\uc1 \u160 ? I will take this casket and give it to him}{\fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af5 \loch \f5 \lang4105 \langnp4105 \langfe4105 \langfenp4105 \line }{\cs22 \fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af5 \loch \f5 \uc1 \u160 ?\uc1 \u160 ?\uc1 \u160 ?\uc1 \u160 ?\uc1 \u160 ? just as it is, and to this gift I will add}{\fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af5 \loch \f5 \lang4105 \langnp4105 \langfe4105 \langfenp4105 \line }{\cs22 \fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af5 \loch \f5 \uc1 \u160 ?\uc1 \u160 ?\uc1 \u160 ?\uc1 \u160 ?\uc1 \u160 ? assurances explaining why you sent it.}{\fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af5 \loch \f5 \lang4105 \langnp4105 \langfe4105 \langfenp4105 \line }{\fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af5 \loch \f5 \lang4105 \langnp4105 \langfe4105 \langfenp4105 \line }{\cs22 \fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af5 \loch \f5 DEIANEIRA}{\fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af5 \loch \f5 \lang4105 \langnp4105 \langfe4105 \langfenp4105 \line }{\cs22 \fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af5 \loch \f5 \uc1 \u160 ?\uc1 \u160 ?\uc1 \u160 ?\uc1 \u160 ?\uc1 \u160 ? You may leave now, for you have a good grasp}{\cs22 \fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af5 \loch \f5 \tab }{\cs26 \fs18 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af5 \loch \f5 760}{\fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af5 \loch \f5 \lang4105 \langnp4105 \langfe4105 \langfenp4105 \line }{\cs22 \fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af5 \loch \f5 \uc1 \u160 ?\uc1 \u160 ?\uc1 \u160 ?\uc1 \u160 ?\uc1 \u160 ? of how things stand with us here in this house.}{\fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af5 \loch \f5 \lang4105 \langnp4105 \langfe4105 \langfenp4105 \line }{\fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af5 \loch \f5 \lang4105 \langnp4105 \langfe4105 \langfenp4105 \line }{\cs22 \fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af5 \loch \f5 LICHAS}{\fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af5 \loch \f5 \lang4105 \langnp4105 \langfe4105 \langfenp4105 \line }{\cs22 \fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af5 \loch \f5 \uc1 \u160 ?\uc1 \u160 ?\uc1 \u160 ?\uc1 \u160 ?\uc1 \u160 ? I understand. I\uc1 \u8217 ?ll tell him all is well.}{\fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af5 \loch \f5 \lang4105 \langnp4105 \langfe4105 \langfenp4105 \line }{\fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af5 \loch \f5 \lang4105 \langnp4105 \langfe4105 \langfenp4105 \line }{\cs22 \fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af5 \loch \f5 DEIANEIRA }{\fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af5 \loch \f5 \lang4105 \langnp4105 \langfe4105 \langfenp4105 \line }{\cs22 \fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af5 \loch \f5 \uc1 \u160 ?\uc1 \u160 ?\uc1 \u160 ?\uc1 \u160 ?\uc1 \u160 ? And you also know how I received her\uc1 \u8212 ?}{\fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af5 \loch \f5 \lang4105 \langnp4105 \langfe4105 \langfenp4105 \line }{\cs22 \fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af5 \loch \f5 \uc1 \u160 ?\uc1 \u160 ?\uc1 \u160 ?\uc1 \u160 ?\uc1 \u160 ? that foreign girl\uc1 \u8212 ?because you witnessed it.}{\fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af5 \loch \f5 \lang4105 \langnp4105 \langfe4105 \langfenp4105 \line }{\cs22 \fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af5 \loch \f5 \uc1 \u160 ?\uc1 \u160 ?\uc1 \u160 ?\uc1 \u160 ?\uc1 \u160 ? I welcomed her as if she were a friend.}{\fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af5 \loch \f5 \lang4105 \langnp4105 \langfe4105 \langfenp4105 \line }{\fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af5 \loch \f5 \lang4105 \langnp4105 \langfe4105 \langfenp4105 \line }{\cs22 \fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af5 \loch \f5 LICHAS}{\fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af5 \loch \f5 \lang4105 \langnp4105 \langfe4105 \langfenp4105 \line }{\cs22 \fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af5 \loch \f5 \uc1 \u160 ?\uc1 \u160 ?\uc1 \u160 ?\uc1 \u160 ?\uc1 \u160 ? I did, and the sight struck my heart with joy.}{\fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af5 \loch \f5 \lang4105 \langnp4105 \langfe4105 \langfenp4105 \line }{\fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af5 \loch \f5 \lang4105 \langnp4105 \langfe4105 \langfenp4105 \line }{\cs22 \fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af5 \loch \f5 DEIANEIRA}{\fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af5 \loch \f5 \lang4105 \langnp4105 \langfe4105 \langfenp4105 \line }{\cs22 \fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af5 \loch \f5 \uc1 \u160 ?\uc1 \u160 ?\uc1 \u160 ?\uc1 \u160 ?\uc1 \u160 ? What else is there to tell? For I\uc1 \u8217 ?m afraid}{\cs22 \fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af5 \loch \f5 \tab }{\cs22 \fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af5 \loch \f5 \tab }{\cs26 \fs18 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af5 \loch \f5 [630]}{\fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af5 \loch \f5 \lang4105 \langnp4105 \langfe4105 \langfenp4105 \line }{\cs22 \fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af5 \loch \f5 \uc1 \u160 ?\uc1 \u160 ?\uc1 \u160 ?\uc1 \u160 ?\uc1 \u160 ? it is too soon to speak of my desire,}{\fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af5 \loch \f5 \lang4105 \langnp4105 \langfe4105 \langfenp4105 \line }{\cs22 \fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af5 \loch \f5 \uc1 \u160 ?\uc1 \u160 ?\uc1 \u160 ?\uc1 \u160 ?\uc1 \u160 ? until I know if he desires me too.}{\fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af5 \loch \f5 \lang4105 \langnp4105 \langfe4105 \langfenp4105 \line }{\fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af5 \loch \f5 \lang4