 \langfenp4105 \line }{\cs22 \fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af5 \loch \f5 \uc1 \u160 ?\uc1 \u160 ?\uc1 \u160 ?\uc1 \u160 ?\uc1 \u160 ? and the Furies see that you are punished! }{\fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af5 \loch \f5 \lang4105 \langnp4105 \langfe4105 \langfenp4105 \line }{\cs22 \fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af5 \loch \f5 \uc1 \u160 ?\uc1 \u160 ?\uc1 \u160 ?\uc1 \u160 ?\uc1 \u160 ? I pray for that, if such a prayer is just.}{\fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af5 \loch \f5 \lang4105 \langnp4105 \langfe4105 \langfenp4105 \line }{\cs22 \fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af5 \loch \f5 \uc1 \u160 ?\uc1 \u160 ?\uc1 \u160 ?\uc1 \u160 ?\uc1 \u160 ? It must be, for to me you have thrown aside}{\cs22 \fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af5 \loch \f5 \tab }{\cs22 \fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af5 \loch \f5 \tab }{\cs26 \fs18 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af5 \loch \f5 [810]}{\fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af5 \loch \f5 \lang4105 \langnp4105 \langfe4105 \langfenp4105 \line }{\cs22 \fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af5 \loch \f5 \uc1 \u160 ?\uc1 \u160 ?\uc1 \u160 ?\uc1 \u160 ?\uc1 \u160 ? all sense of what is right by murdering}{\fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af5 \loch \f5 \lang4105 \langnp4105 \langfe4105 \langfenp4105 \line }{\cs22 \fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af5 \loch \f5 \uc1 \u160 ?\uc1 \u160 ?\uc1 \u160 ?\uc1 \u160 ?\uc1 \u160 ? the finest man of all those on this earth,}{\fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af5 \loch \f5 \lang4105 \langnp4105 \langfe4105 \langfenp4105 \line }{\cs22 \fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af5 \loch \f5 \uc1 \u160 ?\uc1 \u160 ?\uc1 \u160 ?\uc1 \u160 ?\uc1 \u160 ? whose equal you will never see again.}{\fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af5 \loch \f5 \lang4105 \langnp4105 \langfe4105 \langfenp4105 \line }{\fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af5 \loch \f5 \lang4105 \langnp4105 \langfe4105 \langfenp4105 \line }{\cs15 \i1 \fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af5 \lo