les approach his bed and prepare to lift him.]}{\i1 \fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af5 \loch \f5 \lang4105 \langnp4105 \langfe4105 \langfenp4105 \line }{\fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af5 \loch \f5 \lang4105 \langnp4105 \langfe4105 \langfenp4105 \line }{\cs22 \fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af5 \loch \f5 HYLLUS}{\fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af5 \loch \f5 \lang4105 \langnp4105 \langfe4105 \langfenp4105 \line }{\cs22 \fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af5 \loch \f5 \uc1 \u160 ?\uc1 \u160 ?\uc1 \u160 ?\uc1 \u160 ?\uc1 \u160 ? Nothing will interrupt this task, father.}{\fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af5 \loch \f5 \lang4105 \langnp4105 \langfe4105 \langfenp4105 \line }{\cs22 \fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af5 \loch \f5 \uc1 \u160 ?\uc1 \u160 ?\uc1 \u160 ?\uc1 \u160 ?\uc1 \u160 ? Our duty is to follow your commands. }{\fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af5 \loch \f5 \lang4105 \langnp4105 \langfe4105 \langfenp4105 \line }{\fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af5 \loch \f5 \lang4105 \langnp4105 \langfe4105 \langfenp4105 \line }{\cs22 \fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af5 \loch \f5 HERAKLES}{\fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af5 \loch \f5 \lang4105 \langnp4105 \langfe4105 \langfenp4105 \line }{\cs22 \fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af5 \loch \f5 \uc1 \u160 ?\uc1 \u160 ?\uc1 \u160 ?\uc1 \u160 ?\uc1 \u160 ? Come on then, before you wake my sickness.}{\cs22 \fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af5 \loch \f5 \tab }{\cs26 \fs18 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af5 \loch \f5 1500}{\fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af5 \loch \f5 \lang4105 \langnp4105 \langfe4105 \langfenp4105 \line }{\cs22 \fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af5 \loch \f5 \uc1 \u160 ?\uc1 \u160 ?\uc1 \u160 ?\uc1 \u160 ?\uc1 \u160 ? O my unyielding soul, give me a steel clamp}{\cs22 \fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af5 \loch \f5 \tab }{\cs22 \fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af5 \loch \f5 \tab }{\cs26 \fs18 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \