at I do,}{\fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af5 \loch \f5 \lang4105 \langnp4105 \langfe4105 \langfenp4105 \line }{\cs22 \fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af5 \loch \f5 \uc1 \u160 ?\uc1 \u160 ?\uc1 \u160 ?\uc1 \u160 ?\uc1 \u160 ? acknowledging in these events how gods}{\fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af5 \loch \f5 \lang4105 \langnp4105 \langfe4105 \langfenp4105 \line }{\cs22 \fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af5 \loch \f5 \uc1 \u160 ?\uc1 \u160 ?\uc1 \u160 ?\uc1 \u160 ?\uc1 \u160 ? can be so cruel. They bring forth children}{\fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af5 \loch \f5 \lang4105 \langnp4105 \langfe4105 \langfenp4105 \line }{\cs22 \fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af5 \loch \f5 \uc1 \u160 ?\uc1 \u160 ?\uc1 \u160 ?\uc1 \u160 ?\uc1 \u160 ? and are called their fathers, yet they can watch}{\fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af5 \loch \f5 \lang4105 \langnp4105 \langfe4105 \langfenp4105 \line }{\cs22 \fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af5 \loch \f5 \uc1 \u160 ?\uc1 \u160 ?\uc1 \u160 ?\uc1 \u160 ?\uc1 \u160 ? those children suffer in this way. No one}{\cs22 \fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af5 \loch \f5 \tab }{\cs26 \fs18 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af5 \loch \f5 1510}{\fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af5 \loch \f5 \lang4105 \langnp4105 \langfe4105 \langfenp4105 \line }{\cs22 \fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af5 \loch \f5 \uc1 \u160 ?\uc1 \u160 ?\uc1 \u160 ?\uc1 \u160 ?\uc1 \u160 ? can see the future. What\uc1 \u8217 ?s happening now}{\cs22 \fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af5 \loch \f5 \tab }{\cs22 \fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af5 \loch \f5 \tab }{\cs26 \fs18 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af5 \loch \f5 [1270]}{\fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af5 \loch \f5 \lang4105 \langnp4105 \langfe4105 \langfenp4105 \line }{\cs22 \fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af5 \loch \f5 \uc1 \u160 ?\uc1 \u160 ?\uc1 \u160 ?\uc1 \u160 ?\uc1 \u160 ? for us is full of sorrow and for gods above}{\fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \